---
title: Class Times & Locations
---
<p>All Speech &amp; Drama classes are open to children from 4 years up.</p>

{% for venue in venues %}
<hr>
<section class="venue">
  <h2 class="venue-name">{{ venue.name | upper }}</h2>
  <p class="venue-detail">{{ venue.venue }}{% if venue.note %}<br><em>{{ venue.note }}</em>{% endif %}</p>
  {% for day in venue.days %}
  <div class="day">
    <h3>{{ day.day }}</h3>
    {% if day.when %}<p><em>{{ day.when }}</em></p>{% endif %}
    {% if day.slots %}
    <ul class="slots">
      {% for slot in day.slots %}
      <li><span class="time">{{ slot[0] }}</span> {{ slot[1] }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endfor %}
<hr>

<p>Places are strictly limited and will be allocated on a first come, first served basis.</p>
<p>Early booking is therefore advised.</p>
<p>A small exam fee will apply to pupils who wish to take Irish Board of Speech &amp; Drama examinations. This fee will be due in October.</p>
<p><em>Please Note: It is highly recommended that students take these exams.</em></p>
